Setup Proof (VS Code, Node.js, Live Server) 
Setup Proof (VS Code, Node.js, Live Server) means showing proof that we have installed and set up the tools required for web development. VS Code is used to write code, Node.js helps run JavaScript, and Live Server helps us see our webpage in the browser. Ye tools web development ke liye useful hain. Hum in tools ko install karke apna setup ready karte hain aur proof ke liye screenshots le sakte hain.